        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            Zimbabwe's construction sector demands rigorous project control — from tender submission
            through final account. Manage contracts, track costs against budgets in real time, and
            coordinate subcontractors across multiple active sites.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
