        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">From Tender Submission to Contract Award</h2>
        <p>
            The tendering module provides structured bid preparation with bill of quantities management,
            resource estimation, and markup calculation. Track tender submissions, evaluate success rates,
            and maintain a pipeline of upcoming opportunities across public and private sector clients.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Once awarded, contracts transition seamlessly into active project management with budgets,
            schedules, and resource allocations derived directly from the winning tender — eliminating
            re-entry and ensuring the project starts from an accurate financial baseline.
        </p>
