        <p class="section-kicker">Cost Control & Billing</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Real-Time Budget Tracking & Progress Certification</h2>
        <p>
            Every cost element — labor, materials, plant, and subcontractor — is tracked against the
            original budget in real time. Variance analysis identifies overruns before they become
            critical, and earned value metrics provide objective progress measurement that satisfies
            both internal management and external stakeholders.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Progress billing generates interim payment certificates based on measured quantities,
            applying retention percentages and managing variation orders within a controlled workflow.
            Cash flow forecasting ensures the project maintains adequate funding throughout its lifecycle.
        </p>
    </div>
